it matters: Writing forces students to make reasoning explicit and accountable."}, {"id": "87c1859c-dba8-47d1-a660-2c6506493c06", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Research-based argument", "children": [{"id": "3a0aacc7-ec84-4b57-b486-0806d2c9f5de", "type": "concept", "title": "Research question"}, {"id": "140d5305-137e-4c9c-a6a7-c3b312ac4e58", "type": "concept", "title": "Source integration"}, {"id": "b8dd9ead-8fa9-406f-8d4e-898fe81be42d", "type": "concept", "title": "Citation ethics"}, {"id": "70d4a6c1-8489-4b66-8c25-fed8f9670dbd", "type": "concept", "title": "Revision"}], "description": "Why it matters: Source-based writing teaches students to join an inquiry rather than merely state an opinion."}]}, {"id": "be10124e-4bad-427e-9d4e-ef81fe908f5a", "type": "topic", "title": "Capstone Reasoning Portfolio and Real-World Argument Audit", "description": "Synthesize argument analysis, evidence evaluation, logic, writing, and reflection in a substantial final portfolio.", "children": [{"id": "adadf39c-5f9f-46d9-aad7-7469d3dbca2a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Argument audit", "children": [{"id": "61011bfe-00e3-43b5-8d40-c0dc11ff9a86", "type": "concept", "title": "Source collection"}, {"id": "73bdc622-abeb-44cb-b1ca-a89e06b70f9e", "type": "concept", "title": "Argument reconstruction"}, {"id": "6e7bf545-728a-42df-b02b-5db742537895", "type": "concept", "title": "Evidence evaluation"}, {"id": "c5ba8e2f-4f9e-4773-b0a0-f99c79185285", "type": "concept", "title": "Fallacy and bias check"}], "description": "Why it matters: Students apply the full toolkit to a real argument in public, academic, professional, or digital life."}, {"id": "23220c2b-6192-4852-823f-6d9f21d67ce0", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Reasoning portfolio", "children": [{"id": "f8c137bc-74ac-4cbc-8407-505c9c63bf90", "type": "concept", "title": "Problem sets"}, {"id": "f9c24ddc-bc8c-443b-94ab-d21af3f46218", "type": "concept", "title": "Short essays"}, {"id": "5cee0513-82e1-404e-85f3-9563456a7f92", "type": "concept", 